        "id": 1442602
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-13T10:03:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "that\u0027s a good idea, especially if user set the first timeout to e.g max uint16_t so  if we would wait to reschedule a timer with a new value... that could take time ;).",
      "parentUuid": "6ededcac_f0bd1ad7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 115,
